*.download
# No fixture imagery is published. The manifests are the download recipe --
# public URLs, byte counts and SHA256 only -- and `npm run bench` cannot fetch
# or verify a fixture on a fresh clone without them.
fixtures/*
!fixtures/README.md
!fixtures/manifests/
!fixtures/manifests/**

.claude/
